  "content": "<p>\n  <a href=\"https://patreon.com/cw/lolip_p\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/更多內容-000000.svg?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=white\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/Cz2sCWz5Wh\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-5865F2.svg?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\">\n  </a>\n</p><h1>關於：</h1><p><strong>嗨，我是 LoLip_p！我開發這個光影包是為了營造緊張詭異的氛圍，非常適合恐怖整合包。如果能在你的專案中使用它，我會非常開心。它包含了 CRT 濾鏡、各種影片殘影、雜訊效果等功能。如果任何效果不符合你的喜好，所有參數都可以完全自訂，你可以輕鬆開啟或關閉設定。支持作者請到 <a href=\"https://patreon.com/lolip_p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>。</strong></p><h3>截圖：</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/sAZ9WsJP/images/957b7b8e34b8a77f17b347a499c08a2052941c35.jpeg\" alt=\"截圖\"></p><h2>連結：</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://discord.gg/Cz2sCWz5Wh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#b96ad9\">Discord</span></a>（討論、回報錯誤等）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@lolip_p\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">YouTube</span></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ft.me%252fLoLip_p_Community\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\">Telegram</span></a></li>\n</ul><h2>安裝光影包</h2><ul>\n<li>下載支援安裝光影的客戶端，如 Optifine 和 Iris</li>\n<li>下載光影包</li>\n<li>將光影複製到 /.minecraft/shaderpacks</li>\n<li>啟動 Minecraft，前往選項 → 影片設定 → 光影</li>\n<li>選擇 <strong>Cursed Fog</strong></li>\n</ul><h2>示範影片</h2><p><span><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\"> 嵌入已移除：<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fzdIKteyJ0YI\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/zdIKteyJ0YI</a> </span></span></span></span></span></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.neyhost.com%252f%253fref%253dLOLIP30\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/b88f233b0b7819fa09603e3da40613cb199093f7_0.webp\" alt=\"NeyHost\"></a></p>",
